{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">曾紅透香港樂壇與電視圈、被譽為「姊妹花鼻祖」的森森（黎小斌）與斑斑（黎小雯），日前罕有地在社交平台更新近況，分享兩段溫馨影片，隨即喚起大批網民對《歡樂今宵》的集體回憶。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-633\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在流出的影片中，兩姊妹正於餐廳為森森慶祝 75 歲生日，<strong>森森</strong>留著長髮，身穿花卉黑色外衣，手持鮮花，笑容洋溢幸福；<strong>斑斑</strong>則留著清爽短髮，穿上蝴蝶紋上衣，對鏡頭大方「比心」。</p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-633\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"91238b4c-c92c-4bd1-a773-83fabf732785.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QKrqgRHJhz1783915078.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"91238b4c-c92c-4bd1-a773-83fabf732785.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-636\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">雖然姊妹二人已年過七旬且榮升祖母，但她們在鏡頭前依然神采奕奕，凍齡美貌與極佳的精神狀態，令網民紛紛驚嘆她們保養得宜。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-637\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">兩姊妹在事業上有卓越成就，但情感之路卻經歷不少波折與挑戰。</p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-637\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"19e8bd39-04ed-4864-98b9-761415fd9ece.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20264c7UNrrG971783915069.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"19e8bd39-04ed-4864-98b9-761415fd9ece.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-637\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-637\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">森森在1967 年獲「香港歌后」殊榮並加入《歡樂今宵》。年輕時曾與鄭少秋因登台擦出愛火，惜因母親反對等因素未能開花結果。與李小龍胞弟李振輝結合，並於 1980 年誕下兒子李嘉豪，婚姻維持六年。李振輝後來在訪問中自責當年管教過嚴，導致父子關係緊張。1992 年與澳門商人王宗德結婚，移居澳門並逐漸淡出幕前。</p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-637\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_f47486674add4c99-637\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在1992 年，斑斑男友羅石青不敵病魔離世，令她痛失摯愛。沉寂數年後與惠天賜結婚，育有一子，婚姻於五年後結束。2012 年前夫惠天賜於北京離世，斑斑多年來獨力撫養兒子成長，對感情事抱持隨緣態度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T04:18:14.425226+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":513,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}